graph TD
%% Minimalist Observability Stack - K3s + Linkerd + OpenTelemetry + Prometheus + Grafana + Redpanda
%% Render with Mermaid.js
%%
%% Linkerd design principles (operator-focused):
%%  - Keep it simple: explicit, introspectable control-plane components.
%%  - Minimize resources: Linkerd2-proxy (Rust) is a tiny, low-memory data-plane proxy.
%%  - Just work: automatic L7 detection and minimal config to get running.
%%
%% Why we use a service mesh:
%%  The mesh supplies observability, security (mTLS/identity), and reliability
%%  (retries, routing) as an infrastructure layer so AI apps and agents do not
%%  need to implement these features themselves. This enables a pluggable,
%%  standardized Nucleus where services can focus on logic while the mesh
%%  enforces contracts (OpenAPI → HTTPRoute), telemetry, and identity.


    subgraph K3s Node (Single Node)
                subgraph ci-cd
                    GHA[GitHub Actions (CI/CD)]
                    HELM[Helm Chart Render]
                end
            GHA-->|Push/PR triggers|HELM
            HELM-->|Renders manifests|K3s
            GHA-->|kubectl apply|K3s
            classDef ci fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px;
            class GHA,HELM ci;
        direction TB
        subgraph kube-system
            K3s[K3s Control Plane]
        end
        subgraph secrets
            VAULT[Vault\n(KV v2, auth/kubernetes)]
            GHA3[GitHub Actions (Onboard + Bootstrap)]
        end
        %% Authentication flow (Downward API -> Kubernetes JWT -> Vault k8s auth)
        AGENTS-->|ServiceAccount JWT (via Downward API)|VAULT
        GHA3-->|Bootstraps roles/policies|VAULT
        K3s-->|ServiceAccount token review|VAULT
        subgraph linkerd-system
            LINKERD[Linkerd Control Plane (Rust, mTLS, Viz)]
            PROXY[linkerd2-proxy (per-pod sidecar, Rust)\n(lightweight data-plane, mTLS & proxy metrics)]
        end
        subgraph observability
            Prom[Prometheus]
            Graf[Grafana]
            Loki[Loki]
            Tempo[Tempo/Jaeger]
            Alert[Alertmanager]
            OTelC[OpenTelemetry Collector]
        end
        subgraph opencode
            OGW[Opencode Gateway<br/>(OpenTelemetry SDK, W3C headers)]
            AGENTS[IDE Agents<br/>(OpenTelemetry SDK, W3C headers)]
        end
        subgraph lmdeploy
            LMD[LMDeploy<br/>(OpenTelemetry SDK, W3C headers)]
        end
        subgraph ollama
            OLLAMA[Ollama<br/>(LLM Service)]
        end
        subgraph langchain
            LANGCHAIN[LangChain<br/>(Orchestration)]
        end
        subgraph n8n
            N8N[n8n<br/>(Automation)]
        end
        subgraph app
            APP[Your App(s)<br/>(OpenTelemetry SDK, W3C headers)]
            LEARN[Learning Agent & UI<br/>(learning.gentoofoo.local)]
        end
            %% Learning Agent
            LEARN-->|Guidance, explanations, suggestions|APP
            LEARN-->|Lab onboarding, value, how-to|U1
            LEARN-->|Knows user goals, recommends workflows|N8N
            LEARN-->|Explains orchestration|LANGCHAIN
            LEARN-->|Describes memory, ingestion, distillation|MS
        subgraph eventbus
            REDPANDA[Redpanda<br/>(Kafka-compatible Event Bus)]
        end
        subgraph memoryflow["Memory & Knowledge Flow"]
            IG[Ingestion API Service]
            US[Unstructured Service]
            ES[Enrichment Service]
            EMB[Embedding Service]
            MS[Memory Service (pgvector/Postgres)]
            DS[Distillation Service]
            INF[LMDeploy Inference Service]
            MF[MLflow Service]
        end
        subgraph storage["Storage Layer"]
            PG[Postgres + pgvector]
            OBJ[Object Store (S3/MinIO)]
        end
        subgraph models["Models & Registry"]
            MLF[MLflow Registry]
            HF[Hugging Face Hub]
        end
    end

    %% Metrics
    APP-->|/metrics|Prom
    OGW-->|/metrics|Prom
    AGENTS-->|/metrics|Prom
    LMD-->|/metrics|Prom
    OLLAMA-->|/metrics|Prom
    LANGCHAIN-->|/metrics|Prom
    N8N-->|/metrics|Prom
    PROXY-->|Proxy stats|Prom

    %% Memory & Knowledge Flow
    APP-->|HTTP/gRPC|IG
    OGW-->|HTTP/gRPC|IG
    IG-->|produce|REDPANDA
    REDPANDA-->|consume|US
    US-->|produce|REDPANDA
    US-->|store raw/parsed|OBJ
    REDPANDA-->|consume|ES
    ES-->|produce|REDPANDA
    REDPANDA-->|consume|EMB
    EMB-->|produce vectors|REDPANDA
    EMB-->|produce distill candidates|REDPANDA
    REDPANDA-->|consume|MS
    MS-->|write vectors + core metadata|PG
    REDPANDA-->|consume|DS
    DS-->|train/distill|MF
    DS-->|push models/datasets|HF
    DS-->|deploy models|INF
    INF-->|query context|MS
    MS-->|vector search|PG
    MS-->|version_refs|MF
    DS-->|log runs|MF
    APP-->|Memory APIs|MS
    APP-->|Lineage APIs|MF

    %% Tracing
    APP-->|Traces (W3C)|OTelC
    OGW-->|Traces (W3C)|OTelC
    AGENTS-->|Traces (W3C)|OTelC
    LMD-->|Traces (W3C)|OTelC
    OLLAMA-->|Traces (W3C)|OTelC
    LANGCHAIN-->|Traces (W3C)|OTelC
    N8N-->|Traces (W3C)|OTelC
    PROXY-->|Proxy traces|OTelC
    OTelC-->|Traces|Tempo
    OTelC-->|Traces|Jaeger
    OTelC-->|Metrics|Prom

    %% Logs
    Loki-->|Logs|Graf

    %% Dashboards & Alerts
    Prom-->|Dashboards|Graf
    Tempo-->|Traces|Graf
    Prom-->|Alerts|Alert

    %% Service Mesh
    LINKERD-->|Manages|PROXY
    PROXY-->|mTLS (L4)|APP
    PROXY-->|mTLS|OGW
    PROXY-->|mTLS|AGENTS
    PROXY-->|mTLS|LMD
    PROXY-->|mTLS|OLLAMA
    PROXY-->|mTLS|LANGCHAIN
    PROXY-->|mTLS|N8N
    %% L7 routing & OpenAPI: use API Gateway / HTTPRoute semantics; Linkerd does per-pod sidecar routing
    %% For path-based routing/contract validation, translate OpenAPI into HTTPRoute or gateway rules and enforce at the gateway/ingress level.

    %% Event Bus (Redpanda)
    APP-->|Events|REDPANDA
    OGW-->|Events|REDPANDA
    AGENTS-->|Events|REDPANDA
    LMD-->|Events|REDPANDA
    OLLAMA-->|Events|REDPANDA
    LANGCHAIN-->|Events|REDPANDA
    N8N-->|Events|REDPANDA

    %% Failure Events
    APP-->|Failure Event|REDPANDA
    OGW-->|Failure Event|REDPANDA
    AGENTS-->|Failure Event|REDPANDA
    LMD-->|Failure Event|REDPANDA
    OLLAMA-->|Failure Event|REDPANDA
    LANGCHAIN-->|Failure Event|REDPANDA
    N8N-->|Failure Event|REDPANDA

    REDPANDA-->|Failure Topic|SRE

    %% SRE Agentic Workflow
    SRE-->|Query|SRELLM
    SRELLM-->|Solution/Action|SRE
    SRE-->|Auto-Heal/Notify|OGW

    %% Emphasize tracing as key integration
    classDef tracing fill:#ffe082,stroke:#ffb300,stroke-width:2px;
    class OTelC,Tempo,Jaeger tracing;

    %% Service mesh style
    classDef mesh fill:#e0f7fa,stroke:#00acc1,stroke-width:2px;
    class LINKERD,PROXY mesh;

    %% Event bus style
    classDef eventbus fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#8e24aa,stroke-width:2px;
    class REDPANDA eventbus;

    %% SRE agent style
    classDef sre fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px;
    class SRE,SRELLM sre;
